          "output_hash": "f9344530d7fa3f2f",
          "output": "Here's a haiku about being welcomed:\n\nDoors open with warmth\nGentle voices call me in\nHome found in kind words\n\nThis haiku captures the essence of welcome - the opening gesture (doors), the warm reception (gentle voices), and the emotional comfort that comes from being genuinely welcomed (finding home in kindness).",
