          "input_hash": "437aa5444c5f3d9d",
          "output_hash": "b4575c06b8878c04",
          "output": "The translation to French would be:\n\n**Bonjour ! Bienvenue chez Colin.**\n\n**Ceci est un document simple que d'autres documents peuvent r\u00e9f\u00e9rencer.**\n\nNote: \"Colin\" is kept as is since it's a proper name. The translation of \"Welcome to Colin\" uses \"Bienvenue chez Colin\" which is the most natural way to express this in French, though depending on context, \"Bienvenue sur Colin\" could also be used if Colin refers to a platform or website.",
